        <title>Canal_Lines</title>
        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Canal Line - An artificial open channel which provides the supply, distribution or removal of water for irrigation purposes, or for a significant infrastructure function (such as salt interception, land reclamation, or drainage between water features for environmental management purposes). (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Drainage.html)</abstract>
