        <title>Locks</title>
        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Lock - An enclosure in a water body with gates at both ends to raise or lower the water level to enable vessels to pass from one level to another. (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Drainage.html)</abstract>
