        <title>Waterbody_All_Lakes</title>
        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Lake - A naturally occurring body of mainly static water surrounded by land. (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Waterbodies.html). NOTE - This layer only displays 1:300,000 to 1:70,000 to avoid clutter at the national scale (approx 1:36,000,000). Refer to other Waterbody - Lake layers at different scales for the National Map.</abstract>
