        <title>Natural_Water_Points_NativeWell</title>
        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Native Well - An isolated natural depression which holds water, not within Watercourses. The natural phenomena is sometimes improved by indigenous persons for their own water collection purposes. (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Waterbodies.html)</abstract>
