        <title>Natural_Water_Points_Soak</title>
        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Soak - A depression holding moisture after rain, especially the damp or swamp spots around the base of granite rocks. (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Waterbodies.html)</abstract>
