        <abstract>All features have been included from the Surface Hydrology data capture. 250K Specification Description - Swamp - Land which is so saturated with water that it is not suitable for agricultural or pastoral use and presents a barrier to free passage. (Source - http://www.ga.gov.au/mapspecs/topographic/v6/appendixA_files/Waterbodies.html)</abstract>
