        <type>dataset</type>
        <title>National_Ferry_Terminals</title>
        <abstract>The ferry terminals were digitized in 2012 from the library of imagery held within Geoscience Australia. Imagery used ranged from 0.15m to 2.5m resolution.

The database was revised in September 2014; the accuracy and completeness of the dataset reviewed and revised where required.

The first version of this database was subsequently released on the GA website in March 2015.
</abstract>
