        <title>National_Major_Aviation_Terminals</title>
        <abstract>The major aviation terminals dataset was digitized in 2012 from aerial photography, orthophotos and satellite imagery held within Geoscience Australia. The primary information source used to identify and attribute the dataset was the Airservices Australia website supplemented with individual airport websites.</abstract>
